+    "# Vector Cells: BVCs, OVCs and egocentric field of views [![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/TomGeorge1234/RatInABox/blob/dev/demos/vector_cell_demo.ipynb)\n"
