+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "### Initialize Environment, Agent\n",
+    "\n",
+    "First we'll make an environment with three objects in it and a dividing wall. Objects have \"types\" and `ObjectVectorCobject in the centre. "
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "execution_count": 3,
+   "metadata": {},
+   "outputs": [
+    {
+     "name": "stdout",
+     "output_type": "stream",
+     "text": [
+      "Figure saved to /Users/tomgeorge/Documents/RatInABox/figures/21_08_23/Environment_2133.png  & .svg\n"
+     ]
+    },
+    {
+     "data": {
+      "text/plain": [
+       "Text(0.5, 0.98, 'An environment with three objects of two different types')"
+      ]
+     },
+     "execution_count": 3,
+     "metadata": {},
+     "output_type": "execute_result"
+    },
+    {
+     "data": {
+      "image/png": "",
